1
00:00:03,930 --> 00:00:06,400
Hey, you guys. Hey, what are you doing?
嗨，大家！在幹什麼?

2
00:00:06,570 --> 00:00:10,160
-Figuring out our wedding plans. -Funny. We were doing the same thing.
-籌備婚禮 -有趣得很, 我們也正合計這事呢

3
00:00:11,940 --> 00:00:16,070
It's really crazy. The hall, the dress, the food.
瘋了, 場地, 服裝, 食品

4
00:00:16,240 --> 00:00:19,840
-I had no idea how expensive this was. -Yeah, it is really pricey.
-沒想到結個婚這麼貴 -是很貴

5
00:00:20,020 --> 00:00:23,350
-I freaked when I heard the numbers. -So, what did you two do about it?
-第一次算出結婚費用，我被那個數字嚇呆了 -結果你們怎麼做的?

6
00:00:23,520 --> 00:00:26,680
It was simple. I came up with some cost-cutting solutions..
簡單, 我各個項目都想出了一些省錢的方案

7
00:00:26,860 --> 00:00:30,450
wrote out a list, and Monica told me to go to hell.
結果莫妮卡叫我去死

8
00:00:31,260 --> 00:00:35,320
There's no way around it. Just accept that this is gonna cost a lot of money.
沒錢好省的, 接受事實, 這的確所費不貲

9
00:00:35,500 --> 00:00:38,960
I heard that weddings are, like, a $40 billion-a-year industry.
聽說每年花在結婚上的錢高達400億

10
00:00:39,130 --> 00:00:43,330
Yeah. And I'm responsible for just, like, half of that.
這其中我貢獻過半

11
00:00:43,670 --> 00:00:47,160
I don't know. It's a lot of money to spend on one day.
我不知道, 一天花這麼多錢

12
00:00:47,340 --> 00:00:50,180
Hey, I've been married before, I don't need a big wedding.
嘿, 我以前結過婚 我都沒有盛大的婚禮

13
00:00:50,350 --> 00:00:53,610
All I ask is that you don't do ecstasy and make out with my brother.
我所想知道的是你沒有迷上我弟弟並和他上床

14
00:00:55,520 --> 00:00:58,880
But really, it does seem like this money could be put to better use.
我覺得這錢應該用在更有意義的事上

15
00:00:59,050 --> 00:01:01,520
Hey, you could buy a ton of Amway products.
嘿, 你可以買一噸安利的產品

16
00:01:03,860 --> 00:01:07,660
-Or give it all to charity. -Oh, that's great.
-或者全部捐給慈善機構 -喔, 這個想法不錯

17
00:01:07,830 --> 00:01:12,030
How am I gonna unload all those Amway products?
那些安利的東西該怎麼樣卸貨呢?

18
00:01:12,200 --> 00:01:13,260
Are you serious?
當真?

19
00:01:13,440 --> 00:01:17,000
Yeah. How would you feel if we gave all the wedding money to charity..
把婚禮經費捐獻給慈善事業

20
00:01:17,170 --> 00:01:19,300
and we just got married at City Hall?
我們就到市政廳登個記？

21
00:01:19,470 --> 00:01:22,770
I think it would make me wanna marry you even more.
這讓我越發想娶你了!

22
00:01:24,510 --> 00:01:27,810
I gotta say, you guys, that's an incredible gesture.
高姿態! 很好

23
00:01:27,980 --> 00:01:30,970
Maybe you do that next time you get married.
下次你結婚也這麼干如何?

24
00:01:32,190 --> 00:01:36,320
No, no, no. The next time's gonna be Hawaii at sunset.
下次我要在夏威夷斜陽下結婚

25
00:01:36,490 --> 00:01:39,220
But maybe the time after that.
下下次吧

00:01:40,090 --> 00:01:42,020
The One With The Home Study

00:01:43,090 --> 00:01:44,020
rainystar壓制iPod-MP4

26
00:02:28,680 --> 00:02:31,200
-Hey. What's going on? -Hey.
-嘿！ 忙啥呢？ -嘿！

27
00:02:31,380 --> 00:02:35,010
Our adoption social worker is coming, so we're cleaning the apartment.
領養中心有人來家訪，所以我們在掃除

28
00:02:35,180 --> 00:02:37,050
"We"?
我們？

29
00:02:37,590 --> 00:02:41,490
You know you don't want me to help. You can't have it both ways.
你不想我摻和，拖你後腿！

30
00:02:42,920 --> 00:02:46,290
Is this the person who decides whether or not you get a baby?
這個人說了算？

31
00:02:46,460 --> 00:02:49,660
-She's coming to see where we live. -And it has to go perfectly.
－差不多，這人來視察我們的生活環境 －我們必須表現得完美

32
00:02:49,830 --> 00:02:53,670
If she doesn't like us, she can keep us off every adoption list in the state.
若她有絲毫不滿，我們就永遠沒戲

33
00:02:53,840 --> 00:02:57,430
Hey, maybe I should stop by. She could be a soap opera fan.
我可以過來友情協力一把 她沒準愛看肥皂劇

34
00:02:57,610 --> 00:03:01,600
It's very impressive when the little people know a celebrity.
小人物認識演藝名流，可以蓬壁生輝呢

35
00:03:01,780 --> 00:03:03,210
"Little people"?
小人物？

36
00:03:03,380 --> 00:03:05,370
"Celebrity."
名流

37
00:03:06,510 --> 00:03:08,280
So I think I'm just about done here.
差不多滿分了

38
00:03:08,450 --> 00:03:13,220
Unless you have any bad stuff hidden somewhere, like porn or cigarettes?
除非你還有什麼，像色情書刊，香煙？

39
00:03:13,390 --> 00:03:15,150
What?
什麼？

40
00:03:16,260 --> 00:03:18,990
-No. -Chandler.
－才沒有！ －錢德

41
00:03:21,460 --> 00:03:25,360
I don't, and I'm offended by the insinuation.
你無中生有，污人清白

42
00:03:25,530 --> 00:03:28,130
So there's not a magazine under the couch..
沙發下沒有雜誌？

43
00:03:28,300 --> 00:03:31,300
or cigarettes taped to the back of the toilet tank..
廁所水箱後沒有一包香煙？

44
00:03:31,470 --> 00:03:34,030
or a filthy video in the VCR?
錄像機裡沒有A片?

45
00:03:35,040 --> 00:03:38,640
I'll admit to the cigarettes and magazine. But that tape is not mine.
香煙和雜誌我認帳，但錄像帶
不是我的！

46
00:03:38,810 --> 00:03:42,870
-It isn't mine. -I guess we'll never know whose it is.
-也不是我的！ -永遠不會知道是誰的了！

47
00:03:50,660 --> 00:03:51,680
May I help you?
可以幫忙嗎？

48
00:03:51,860 --> 00:03:55,450
Yes. We're here to make a rather sizable donation to the children.
我們來捐錢給孩子

49
00:03:55,630 --> 00:03:58,220
Any contribution, large or small, is appreciated.
捐錢不論多少，心意都是一樣重 我們都會感激

50
00:03:58,400 --> 00:04:01,600
I think you're gonna appreciate the crap out of this one.
數目這樣大，你一定會異常感激

51
00:04:01,770 --> 00:04:05,140
-Well, this is very generous. -And we don't want any recognition.
-你們真大方 -我們不留名．

52
00:04:05,310 --> 00:04:07,000
This is completely anonymous.
匿名捐助

53
00:04:07,180 --> 00:04:09,770
Completely anonymous. From two kind strangers.
完全匿名 兩個好人

54
00:04:09,940 --> 00:04:12,440
Mr. X and Phoebe Buffay.
X先生和菲比布費

55
00:04:14,080 --> 00:04:16,020
We can put your names in our newsletter.
我們可以把二位的名字登到新聞通訊裡

56
00:04:16,180 --> 00:04:19,120
-Not necessary. -Buffay is spelled B-U-F-F-A-Y.
－沒必要 －布費的拼法是：Buffay

57
00:04:20,390 --> 00:04:24,550
And X is spelled "Mike Hannigan."
X先生的寫法是：麥克.哈納根

58
00:04:25,290 --> 00:04:29,530
Possible headline: Attractive Couple Makes World Better.
也許標題應該寫: 迷人的夫婦讓世界變的更好

59
00:04:30,100 --> 00:04:32,900
Well, on behalf of the children, thank you both very much.
我代表孩子們多謝兩位

60
00:04:33,070 --> 00:04:37,370
-I'm glad we did this. It feels so good. -It does. It feels really good.
-感覺真棒 -是啊，非常棒。

61
00:04:37,540 --> 00:04:40,170
Oh, look. And we get these free T-shirts.
還有免費T恤拿

62
00:04:40,340 --> 00:04:43,540
Actually, that's the shirt I wore to the gym.
那是我健身穿的

63
00:04:43,910 --> 00:04:45,540
It's moist.
難怪是濕的

64
00:04:50,590 --> 00:04:53,280
-Hi. Emma will be up in a minute. -Oh, good.
-艾瑪會很快起床的 -哦，天啊。

65
00:04:53,450 --> 00:04:57,910
Hey, Ross, listen. I heard about you and Charlie. I'm really sorry.
嘿，羅斯 聽說你跟查莉的事了, 替你難過

66
00:04:58,090 --> 00:05:02,290
That's okay. I'm sure there are tons of other beautiful paleontologists out there.
沒事, 美貌的考古學家多的是!

67
00:05:02,460 --> 00:05:05,260
-Absolutely. -There was one. She's it.
-當然! -只有一個!就是她!

68
00:05:05,430 --> 00:05:08,630
All the rest look like they should live under a bridge.
其他的就好像是橋洞居民一樣!

69
00:05:11,310 --> 00:05:12,900
So, what are you gonna do today?
今天想怎麼玩?

70
00:05:13,070 --> 00:05:15,370
I was thinking of taking Emma to the playground.
帶艾瑪去街心遊樂場怎麼樣?

71
00:05:15,680 --> 00:05:18,080
Oh, my God. What?
什麼?

72
00:05:19,550 --> 00:05:24,250
Like I said, I was thinking of taking Emma to the Museum of Knives and Fire.
我又沒說帶她去武器彈藥博物館

73
00:05:26,790 --> 00:05:32,590
Okay, look, Ross. I do not want Emma going to the playground.
我反對艾瑪去遊樂場

74
00:05:35,760 --> 00:05:36,960
Because..?
因為?

75
00:05:37,130 --> 00:05:40,830
All right, if you must know, I had a traumatic..
好吧，如果你想知道…

76
00:05:41,000 --> 00:05:44,670
swing incident when I was little.
我小時候蕩鞦韆遇險

77
00:05:45,570 --> 00:05:47,510
-Seriously? -Yes. I was 4 years old.
-真的? -我才四歲

78
00:05:47,680 --> 00:05:49,510
And I was on the swing..
我蕩鞦韆

79
00:05:49,680 --> 00:05:53,510
and then all of a sudden my hair got tangled in the chain.
突然頭髮纏到鐵鏈

80
00:05:55,380 --> 00:06:00,290
And to get me out, my mom had to cut a big chunk of my hair.
結果老媽剪掉我一大縷頭髮, 才救我出來

81
00:06:01,590 --> 00:06:04,650
And it was uneven for weeks.
結果有好幾星期頭髮都不整齊

82
00:06:10,370 --> 00:06:13,600
And you made it through that?
你竟熬了過來?

83
00:06:14,340 --> 00:06:17,860
I wonder who's gonna play you in the movie.
簡直可以拍成電影

84
00:06:18,810 --> 00:06:22,670
Okay, fine, you can make fun of me. I do not want Emma going there.
你儘管拿我取笑, 反正我就是不想艾瑪去

85
00:06:22,840 --> 00:06:25,440
And I was thinking Claire Danes.
而且我在想克萊爾·丹妮絲

86
00:06:26,480 --> 00:06:28,920
Look, I'm sorry to hear about your tragedy.
你的悲劇令我同情

87
00:06:29,080 --> 00:06:32,850
But the swings are perfectly safe. And besides, Emma loves them.
不過鞦韆很安全 而且艾瑪喜歡蕩鞦韆

88
00:06:33,020 --> 00:06:38,050
-You should come, and you'll see. -Those things go, like,40 miles an hour.
-我們同去, 你就知道了 -鞦韆速度40英里/小時

89
00:06:38,230 --> 00:06:40,560
And there's that moment when you're at the top..
蕩到高處

90
00:06:40,730 --> 00:06:44,530
when you just don't know if you're gonna return back to Earth.
鬼才知道會不會返回地球

91
00:06:46,170 --> 00:06:49,100
Space is filled with orbiting children.
宇宙充滿小孩子繞軌道運行

92
00:06:52,240 --> 00:06:54,400
Look, please, just come on.
來嘛

93
00:06:54,580 --> 00:06:58,100
When you see the look on Emma's face, I swear, you won't regret it.
你若看見艾瑪的表情, 決不會後悔

94
00:07:00,780 --> 00:07:02,220
-All right. -Good.
-好吧 -太好了。

95
00:07:02,380 --> 00:07:07,290
You don't wanna be a mom who passes her irrational fears to her children.
你不會像有的媽媽那樣 把自己愚昧的恐懼遺傳給小孩吧

96
00:07:07,460 --> 00:07:08,920
"Irrational, " huh?
愚昧?

97
00:07:09,090 --> 00:07:12,790
I'll remember that next time you freak out about a spider in your apartment.
下次你被家裡的蜘蛛嚇到 我們再談這個話題

98
00:07:12,960 --> 00:07:17,230
That's the same. I'm sure there are 30 different species of poisonous swings.
這兩個可以相提並論嗎! 鞦韆上有30種毒液?

99
00:07:21,540 --> 00:07:23,560
Oh, my God. The adoption lady is early.
哦，天，領養中心的來早了

100
00:07:23,740 --> 00:07:27,070
Okay. Okay. Here we go. Here we go.
好的好的.鎮靜鎮靜!!!

101
00:07:27,240 --> 00:07:28,570
Stand up straight.
站直咯

102
00:07:28,740 --> 00:07:30,610
Big smile.
微笑

103
00:07:33,110 --> 00:07:35,980
Hello. Is this the Creepy residence?
你好, 請問這是"毛骨悚然"家嗎?

104
00:07:36,150 --> 00:07:39,590
We're waiting for the adoption lady. But I'm glad you're here.
還以為是領養中心的來了 你來得正好

105
00:07:39,750 --> 00:07:42,280
I was cleaning this morning and I found this.
今早打掃時發現的, 不知道你用不用得上

106
00:07:42,460 --> 00:07:45,450
I don't know if you wanna use it, but..
我不知道你是不是想用, 但是.........

107
00:07:45,630 --> 00:07:48,720
Oh, this is so sweet of you.
你真好

108
00:07:48,900 --> 00:07:52,700
But I won't be needing a veil. I actually won't be wearing a dress at all.
不過我不需要頭紗, 我根本不需要服裝

109
00:07:52,870 --> 00:07:55,890
I told you, I am not coming to a naked wedding!
裸體婚禮, 我不會參加的!

110
00:07:56,070 --> 00:07:58,330
No. We're not having a big reception.
我們不會開招待會

111
00:07:58,510 --> 00:08:02,340
We took the wedding money and donated it to a children's charity.
我們把婚禮經費捐給兒童慈善事業了

112
00:08:02,510 --> 00:08:04,170
That's crazy!
你瘋啦?

113
00:08:06,580 --> 00:08:10,240
-Generous. -Crazy generous.
-慷慨啊！ -你瘋啦?

114
00:08:11,290 --> 00:08:15,480
I'm sorry. I can't imagine giving up my one wedding day like that.
抱歉, 只是無法想像. 一生只有一次啊

115
00:08:15,660 --> 00:08:18,990
Well, we're different. I don't care about having a huge party.
我們不一樣! 我不在乎什麼盛大婚禮

116
00:08:19,160 --> 00:08:21,460
This is really nice for you, but..
頭紗是很美, 但是

117
00:08:21,630 --> 00:08:25,190
Oh, please. I put this on and I just look like..
你看我戴上, 簡直就--

118
00:08:25,370 --> 00:08:27,560
Well, radiant.
美極

119
00:08:29,600 --> 00:08:33,510
All right, but who cares? I don't need a pretty veil and a fancy dress.
管它!我不需要頭紗婚紗這些玩意

120
00:08:33,670 --> 00:08:35,870
That's right. You're making a commitment.
對! 你們是互許終身

121
00:08:36,040 --> 00:08:39,340
You know, that's the same whether you do it at the Plaza or..
不管在廣場舉行還是別的什麼地方都是一樣

122
00:08:39,510 --> 00:08:41,410
-Where you gonna do it? -City Hall.
-你選了啥地方? -市政廳

123
00:08:43,320 --> 00:08:46,220
Oh, that sounds nice.
好地方

124
00:08:46,390 --> 00:08:50,620
I was just there for jury duty. They've really spruced that place up.
市政廳的人該忙不過來了

125
00:08:50,790 --> 00:08:55,460
Okay. It's okay. It's okay. It's okay. I've made my decision.
沒關係, 這是我自己的決定

126
00:08:55,630 --> 00:08:58,360
What I really want is a great big wedding.
但我真正想要的, 只是一個盛大的婚禮

127
00:09:00,670 --> 00:09:05,130
-But you gave all the money to charity. -Well, I'll just ask for it back.
-但錢已經捐啦 -可以要回來

128
00:09:06,540 --> 00:09:08,770
-I don't think you can do that. -Why not?
-不行吧 -怎麼不行?

129
00:09:08,940 --> 00:09:13,240
This is her wedding day. That's way more important than some stupid kids.
她結婚!這可比什麼 愚蠢的小孩子重要多了!

130
00:09:14,480 --> 00:09:17,920
That's sweet, honey, but save something for the adoption lady.
說得好, 省著點, 等領養中心的人來了 再表演不好嗎

131
00:09:24,530 --> 00:09:27,360
-All right, okay. Be careful. -Okay.
-好，準備就緒 -好

132
00:09:27,530 --> 00:09:30,900
Careful. Watch her hair. Watch her hair!
小心, 小心她頭髮

133
00:09:31,400 --> 00:09:34,730
-Rach, she's got, like, three hairs. -I know. I know.
-她才三根毛! -我知道，我知道  

134
00:09:34,900 --> 00:09:40,100
But they're just so beautiful. Oh, my God, I just pulled one out.
但是很漂亮 糟糕, 扯掉一根

135
00:09:40,270 --> 00:09:43,940
I promise you she's safe. Watch how much she loves this.
我保證，她很安全, 你看她多喜歡玩鞦韆

136
00:09:44,110 --> 00:09:47,670
-Okay. Okay. -Are you ready, sweetie? Here we go.
-好吧好吧 -你準備好了嗎, 親愛的? 開始嘍

137
00:09:48,680 --> 00:09:51,950
Okay, careful. Okay.
小心

138
00:09:55,960 --> 00:09:57,950
She's smiling.
她笑了

139
00:09:58,130 --> 00:10:00,420
Look at that, she does like it.
她真的很喜歡

140
00:10:00,600 --> 00:10:02,430
See, I told you.
看, 我告訴過你的吧

141
00:10:07,370 --> 00:10:11,200
Oh, my God. Look at her, she's a little daredevil.
哦, 天啊, 看看她, 真有不怕死的精神.

142
00:10:11,370 --> 00:10:15,780
-Oh, God. Let me push. Can I push? -Oh, absolutely.
-讓我推好不好? -哦，當然。

143
00:10:15,940 --> 00:10:19,400
Oh, God. Okay, get the camera. It's in the diaper bag.
你拿相機, 在尿布包裡

144
00:10:19,580 --> 00:10:21,170
Okay.
好。

145
00:10:21,350 --> 00:10:25,010
See? Scared of the swings. I bet you feel pretty silly.
還怕鞦韆, 真夠傻吧?

146
00:10:30,290 --> 00:10:33,990
-We're asking for the money back? -It's for our wedding day.
-我們真要把錢要回來? -結婚要用!

147
00:10:34,160 --> 00:10:38,360
Now, is this guy gay or straight? Because one of us has to start flirting.
這小子喜歡男的女的? 我們非得出美人計

148
00:10:39,870 --> 00:10:42,030
You here to make another donation the same day?
同一天捐兩次錢

149
00:10:42,200 --> 00:10:44,140
I don't think that's ever happened before.
前所未有呢

150
00:10:44,310 --> 00:10:46,000
Gay. Go.
是個同性戀, 你上

151
00:10:49,010 --> 00:10:51,950
Oh, my God, I love your shirt.
你衣裳真帥

152
00:10:53,280 --> 00:10:57,840
The donation we made earlier? Well, we want it back.
今天捐的錢, 我們想要回

153
00:10:59,090 --> 00:11:00,140
Excuse me?
啊?

154
00:11:00,320 --> 00:11:03,920
Okay, that money was for a big wedding we thought we didn't want.
那是辦婚禮的錢, 我們本想從簡

155
00:11:04,090 --> 00:11:05,390
But it turns out we do.
但現在我們改變了主意

156
00:11:05,560 --> 00:11:09,090
So you're asking us to refund your donation to the children?
要我們退還你們捐給孩子們的錢?

157
00:11:09,600 --> 00:11:11,030
Yeah.
對!

158
00:11:12,330 --> 00:11:14,670
This feels really good.
聽來不錯

159
00:11:17,910 --> 00:11:21,810
I'm sorry. I am. But this wedding's just really important to me.
對不起, 但婚禮對我相當重要

160
00:11:21,980 --> 00:11:25,640
Hey, it's none of my business. Besides, this is probably a good thing.
關我啥事 這也許是好事

161
00:11:25,810 --> 00:11:30,440
We've really been spoiling the children, what with all the food and warm clothing.
別把孩子慣壞了 讓他們吃飽穿暖怎麼行

162
00:11:31,120 --> 00:11:34,180
That's not fair. A person's wedding is important.
這麼說不公平, 結婚是大事

163
00:11:34,360 --> 00:11:35,950
And especially to me.
尤其對我!

164
00:11:36,120 --> 00:11:39,920
I didn't have a graduation party. And I didn't go to prom.
我沒參加過畢業典禮, 沒有畢業舞會

165
00:11:40,090 --> 00:11:43,930
And I spent my sweet 16 being chased around a tire yard..
在我的甜蜜16歲, 

166
00:11:44,100 --> 00:11:47,730
by an escaped mental patient who, in his own words, wanted to:
我被精神病人狂追 他還說

167
00:11:47,900 --> 00:11:49,490
"Kill me, or whatever."
"殺了我什麼的"

168
00:11:51,140 --> 00:11:54,070
So I deserve a real celebration.
我應當有個隆重的婚禮!

169
00:11:54,240 --> 00:11:58,610
And I'm not gonna let some sweaty little man make me feel badly about it.
你個流汗男, 別想讓我內疚!

170
00:12:03,080 --> 00:12:06,450
She could've been talking about either one of us.
她可能在說我們中的一個

171
00:12:11,360 --> 00:12:14,190
Okay. Here we go.
好的, 來吧

172
00:12:16,900 --> 00:12:18,590
Good luck.
祝好運

173
00:12:19,400 --> 00:12:21,330
Tongue, really?
舌吻?

174
00:12:24,570 --> 00:12:27,470
Hi, I'm Laura. I'm here for your adoption interview.
我叫勞拉, 我來做領養家訪

175
00:12:27,640 --> 00:12:30,270
Hi, I'm Monica. And this is Chandler.
我叫莫妮卡, 這是錢德

176
00:12:30,440 --> 00:12:32,670
-Please come in. -Thank you.
-請進！ -謝謝

177
00:12:32,850 --> 00:12:35,980
-Would you like something to drink? -Water would be fine.
-請進.喝點什麼? -喝水可以了

178
00:12:36,150 --> 00:12:38,210
We're so glad that you're here.
很高興你終於來了

179
00:12:38,390 --> 00:12:41,050
We're excited about getting this process started.
我們好興奮，要開始領養小孩了

180
00:12:41,220 --> 00:12:44,190
Because we love kids. Love them to death.
我們愛小孩, 愛得要死

181
00:12:44,360 --> 00:12:47,790
Well, not actually to death. That's just a figure of speech.
不是要孩子"死", 只是修辭手法

182
00:12:47,960 --> 00:12:50,120
We love kids the appropriate amount..
我們愛孩子, 不多不少

183
00:12:51,830 --> 00:12:54,100
as allowed by law.
符合法律法規

184
00:12:55,940 --> 00:12:58,300
-Your place is just lovely. -Thank you.
-你們家好可愛 -謝謝

185
00:12:58,470 --> 00:13:02,410
Yes, this building does have a wholesome, family feel to it.
這棟樓有很多家住戶

186
00:13:02,580 --> 00:13:07,010
I feel like I've been here before. Any other couples in the building adopting?
我好像來過, 這裡還有誰申請領養?

187
00:13:07,180 --> 00:13:11,550
Is that that couple on the first floor? We should get a baby before them.
一樓那家? 我們應該比他們先要孩子

188
00:13:11,720 --> 00:13:13,620
That guy tried to sell me drugs.
他還想賣毒品給我

189
00:13:15,260 --> 00:13:18,890
But other than that, wholesome, wholesome building.
其他都是好人

190
00:13:21,160 --> 00:13:24,650
-What? -I realized why I remember this place.
-怎麼？ -我想起來了, 難怪來過

191
00:13:24,830 --> 00:13:26,960
-Really? What is it? -Oh, it's nothing.
-怎麼? -哦，沒什麼！

192
00:13:27,130 --> 00:13:31,370
I went on a date with a guy who lived in this building. It didn't end very well.
我和一個男人約會, 結果無疾而終

193
00:13:31,540 --> 00:13:34,530
That wouldn't, by any chance, be Joey Tribbiani?
那人該不是叫喬伊崔比阿尼吧?

194
00:13:34,710 --> 00:13:37,700
-Yes! -Of course it was.
-就是他! -當然是他

195
00:13:38,510 --> 00:13:42,810
We had a great night. In the morning, he promised he'd call and he didn't.
良宵過後, 他說他再打電話給我 結果再沒聯絡!

196
00:13:42,980 --> 00:13:44,510
Rat bastard!
這混球!

197
00:13:46,520 --> 00:13:49,150
-So you're not friends with him? -Oh, God, no.
-你們該不是他朋友? -當然不是!不!

198
00:13:49,320 --> 00:13:51,810
-No, no, no. -No. Nope.
-當然不是!不! -當然不是！  

199
00:13:59,070 --> 00:14:01,400
Well, I'm sorry I brought it up.
抱歉提這事

200
00:14:01,570 --> 00:14:04,830
So are either one of you planning on staying at home?
那麼你們當中有人打算待在家裡嗎？

201
00:14:05,010 --> 00:14:09,970
Hello? Anybody in there order a celebrity?
有人嗎? 名人駕到

202
00:14:13,210 --> 00:14:14,310
What was that?
什麼人?

203
00:14:14,480 --> 00:14:18,110
That's just some crazy guy who roams the halls here.
過道上的瘋子

204
00:14:18,290 --> 00:14:20,190
He's great with kids, though.
不過他對小孩很慈祥

205
00:14:26,460 --> 00:14:30,950
-Ross. Oh, my God, are you okay? -Son of a bitch!
-羅斯，噢，天啊， 你還好? -他娘的!

206
00:14:34,340 --> 00:14:37,130
Oh, relax. I didn't say the F-word.
別緊張，我又沒說F打頭那個字!

207
00:14:39,410 --> 00:14:42,310
Ross, see, I told you! Those swings are evil!
羅斯，看, 早告訴你了, 鞦韆危險

208
00:14:42,480 --> 00:14:47,310
That's the last time Emma is getting on one of those things for her entire life.
算了, 這輩子再也不許艾瑪接近它

209
00:14:47,480 --> 00:14:51,210
No, no, no. Okay, it wasn't the swing's fault. It was my fault.
別這樣, 不是鞦韆的錯, 是我錯

210
00:14:51,390 --> 00:14:54,250
And kind of that kid's fault.
還有他的錯

211
00:14:54,420 --> 00:14:57,450
Who is still laughing. Nice.
他還笑, 算你恨

212
00:14:57,630 --> 00:15:01,190
Come on. Can we just get out of here before somebody else gets hurt?
在再有人受傷之前，我們走吧

213
00:15:01,360 --> 00:15:04,700
No. Wait. I have an idea. I want you to get on the swing..
這樣吧, 你去蕩鞦韆, 你就會…

214
00:15:04,870 --> 00:15:08,160
and you'll see that there's nothing to be afraid of.
發現那有多安全

215
00:15:10,800 --> 00:15:13,330
I know what this is all about.
我明白了

216
00:15:13,810 --> 00:15:17,170
You've always been jealous of my hair.
你一貫嫉妒我頭髮

217
00:15:17,610 --> 00:15:21,710
I just think you're an adult, okay? And you should get over your silly fears.
這才是成年人的做法 克服愚蠢的恐懼

218
00:15:21,880 --> 00:15:24,040
-All right, fine. I'll do it. -Good.
-好!誰怕誰 -好！

219
00:15:24,220 --> 00:15:27,310
-If you hold a spider. -Where?! Where?!
-如果你敢抓蜘蛛 -在哪兒?

220
00:15:27,960 --> 00:15:30,420
If you hold a spider.
我說"如果"你敢抓蜘蛛

221
00:15:30,590 --> 00:15:32,290
I know.
聽見了

222
00:15:39,370 --> 00:15:42,730
Guys, is everything okay? It's me, Joey.
沒事吧? 是我, 喬伊--

223
00:15:44,940 --> 00:15:46,630
Adoption!
領養!

224
00:15:48,410 --> 00:15:49,710
What's going on?
到底什麼事?

225
00:15:49,880 --> 00:15:52,470
Oh, it's just like I said, that crazy..
就是那個瘋子...

226
00:15:52,650 --> 00:15:56,170
Bert, roaming the halls.
叫bert的 在過道上跑

227
00:15:56,350 --> 00:15:59,480
-Guys? -Keep on roaming, Bert!
-嗨！ -bert, 接著跑

228
00:15:59,650 --> 00:16:02,520
We don't want any crazy today!
今天我們不看你瘋了

229
00:16:03,990 --> 00:16:05,960
Is he all right out there by himself?
他獨自一個在外面，不會出事吧?

230
00:16:06,130 --> 00:16:09,460
Oh, yeah. He has a caretaker. His older brother..
沒事, 他哥照顧他

231
00:16:09,630 --> 00:16:10,760
Ernie.
叫ernie

232
00:16:13,400 --> 00:16:18,240
-Bert and Ernie? -You can't make this stuff up.
-Bert 和 Ernie? (芝麻街的動畫角色)? -無巧不成書

233
00:16:19,470 --> 00:16:23,380
-What's going on? -We'll talk later! Everything's fine!
-怎麼了？ -我們等會再說，一切都好！

234
00:16:24,110 --> 00:16:26,670
Everything doesn't sound fine.
聽起來一切都不好！

235
00:16:35,990 --> 00:16:38,890
Bert and Ernie have a big yellow bird.
Bert 和 Ernie 有一隻大黃鳥！

236
00:16:41,760 --> 00:16:44,960
You never told me about that guy and your sweet 16.
你沒說過你16歲時被男人追殺的故事

237
00:16:45,130 --> 00:16:47,600
-I'm sorry about that. -Oh, it ended okay.
-真可憐 -結局還算好

238
00:16:47,770 --> 00:16:49,740
One of my friends shot him.
我朋友斃了他

239
00:16:51,540 --> 00:16:55,070
At least you'll get a proper wedding. You really deserve that.
至少你會有個體面婚禮, 你該得的

240
00:16:55,240 --> 00:16:59,180
Yeah, I really do. You know, I had nothing growing up.
沒錯, 我這輩子還沒風光過

241
00:17:01,650 --> 00:17:03,980
Just like the kids I took the money from.
就像被我剝奪金錢的那些孩子一樣

242
00:17:04,150 --> 00:17:08,990
No. No, no. I see where this is going. Don't make me go back there.
看出你苗頭了, 別又想讓我退回去

243
00:17:09,160 --> 00:17:11,950
I'm sorry, but I want to regive the money to the children.
抱歉, 但我又想把錢給孩子們了

244
00:17:12,130 --> 00:17:16,320
But we can't. I mean, you called that guy a sweaty little man.
但是我們不能, 我是說 你管那男人叫流汗男

245
00:17:16,700 --> 00:17:19,720
Unless you were talking about me. We never really cleared that up.
除非你在說我 我們從沒真正弄乾淨過

246
00:17:20,200 --> 00:17:24,300
Look, I can't have a wedding with this money now. It's tainted.
我不能用這錢辦婚事, 這不道德

247
00:17:25,410 --> 00:17:26,930
Fine, we'll give the money back.
好吧, 退回去作數

248
00:17:27,110 --> 00:17:29,540
If that guy at the charity gives us a hard time..
如果慈善捐助處那傢伙又叫咱們難看

249
00:17:29,710 --> 00:17:33,040
my friend hasn't shot anyone in a really long time.
我朋友的老槍好久沒見過血了

250
00:17:34,880 --> 00:17:38,370
I must say this seems like a lovely environment to raise a child in.
我想說, 這個家庭培養小孩似乎很理想

251
00:17:38,550 --> 00:17:41,450
You are welcome to look under any of the furniture..
你盡可以在各種傢俱下面搜查

252
00:17:41,620 --> 00:17:45,110
because, believe me, you won't find any porn or cigarettes under there.
絕無色情書刊和香煙什麼的!

253
00:17:46,190 --> 00:17:50,690
Before we look around, let me make sure I have everything I need up to here.
在到處看看之前, 要問你們一些問題

254
00:17:56,470 --> 00:17:59,000
Why don't I show you the baby's room.
帶你看看嬰兒房

255
00:18:03,840 --> 00:18:05,870
-What are you doing? -You wouldn't let me in.
-你幹啥? -你不讓我進來

256
00:18:06,050 --> 00:18:08,340
-I thought you were in trouble. -Well, we're not.
-我以為你們出事了 -才沒有!

257
00:18:08,520 --> 00:18:10,810
But you called me "Bert."
但你叫我"bert", 

258
00:18:11,450 --> 00:18:13,480
That's our code word for danger.
那是"危險"的暗號

259
00:18:14,590 --> 00:18:18,580
-We don't have a code word. -We don't?
-我們沒約定過什麼暗號 -是嗎？ 

260
00:18:18,760 --> 00:18:20,490
We really should.
應該約一個

261
00:18:20,660 --> 00:18:24,600
From now on, "Bert" will be our code word for danger.
從今往後，"bert"就用來作為 遇到危險的暗號

262
00:18:24,770 --> 00:18:27,360
So that was the baby's room.
參觀完嬰兒房

263
00:18:29,040 --> 00:18:33,470
-What room should we see next? -Any room that isn't behind this couch.
-下面參觀哪裡？ -除了沙發下面都可以參觀！

264
00:18:35,310 --> 00:18:39,140
Some people don't get him, but I think he's really funny.
有些人不懂他的笑話 但我覺得他真幽默

265
00:18:46,150 --> 00:18:48,820
I did not care for that.
我不在乎被你粗暴對待

266
00:18:49,590 --> 00:18:50,820
You have to leave.
你得迴避

267
00:18:50,990 --> 00:18:53,720
You slept with our social worker and never called her back.
你和這個社工睡過，再沒聯絡她

268
00:18:53,890 --> 00:18:55,920
She is still pissed, so she can't see you.
她還在生你的氣，不能讓她見你

269
00:18:56,100 --> 00:18:57,930
Okay, okay.
好，好，好！我躲起來

270
00:19:00,830 --> 00:19:03,670
-What? -I forgot my bat.
-怎麼了？ -忘了拿球棒

271
00:19:06,440 --> 00:19:08,340
Oh, my God.
天！

272
00:19:08,510 --> 00:19:12,710
And for the last time, we do not want to be friends with you!
最後警告，我們不想和你做朋友！

273
00:19:15,080 --> 00:19:17,950
And we don't wanna buy your bat!
也不想買你的球棒！

274
00:19:19,290 --> 00:19:21,050
What are you doing here?
你在這兒幹什麼？

275
00:19:21,220 --> 00:19:23,990
Bert. Bert. Bert. Bert.
Bert. Bert. Bert. Bert.

276
00:19:27,630 --> 00:19:31,090
-Are you friends with him? -I can explain.
-你們是朋友？ -我來解釋

277
00:19:31,800 --> 00:19:33,360
Joey?
喬伊你說

278
00:19:34,100 --> 00:19:36,040
All right. Okay.
好吧！

279
00:19:40,410 --> 00:19:43,170
You have got some nerve coming back here.
你還敢回來

280
00:19:45,010 --> 00:19:47,640
-I can't believe you never called me. -Excuse me?
-你竟不打電話給我 -啊？

281
00:19:48,150 --> 00:19:52,020
You probably don't even remember my name. It's Joey, by the way.
你連我名字也忘了，我叫喬伊

282
00:19:52,190 --> 00:19:56,520
And don't bother telling me yours, because I totally remember it, lady.
不必說你的名字，我記得，女士

283
00:19:59,030 --> 00:20:01,120
I waited weeks for you to call me.
我一直等你電話

284
00:20:01,300 --> 00:20:03,350
I gave you my number. You never called me.
我給你電話號碼，你沒聯絡我

285
00:20:03,530 --> 00:20:05,690
Don't try to turn this around on me.
還想栽贓給我

286
00:20:05,870 --> 00:20:09,960
I am not some kind of social work..
我可不是讓你

287
00:20:10,140 --> 00:20:11,570
that you can just..
為所欲為的

288
00:20:11,740 --> 00:20:13,210
do.
〞社工〞

289
00:20:16,240 --> 00:20:20,650
-I'm pretty sure I gave you my number. -Really? Think about it. Come on.
-我確信給過你電話 -真的？你想想看

290
00:20:20,810 --> 00:20:24,310
You're a beautiful woman. Smart, funny.
你漂亮，聰明，有趣

291
00:20:24,480 --> 00:20:26,920
We had a really good time.
咱們春風一度

292
00:20:28,190 --> 00:20:31,020
If I had your number, why wouldn't I call you?
如果我有你電話，怎麼可能不打給你？

293
00:20:31,690 --> 00:20:32,750
I don't know.
我就是不知道呀

294
00:20:35,130 --> 00:20:37,150
Well, maybe I'm wrong. I'm sorry.
可能我搞錯了，對不起

295
00:20:37,330 --> 00:20:42,200
Hey, too late for apologies. Okay? You broke my heart.
現在道歉太晚啦 你傷了我的心

296
00:20:42,370 --> 00:20:45,900
You know how many women I had to sleep with to get over you?
就為了忘掉你，我睡了多少女人啊！

297
00:20:48,980 --> 00:20:51,070
-Joey, wait.. -No!
-喬伊，等等 -不！

298
00:20:51,250 --> 00:20:54,210
I waited a long time! I can't wait anymore.
我等得夠久，不可能再等了

299
00:20:57,750 --> 00:21:00,650
I'm sorry that you had to see that. I'm so embarrassed.
抱歉讓你們笑話了，真尷尬

300
00:21:00,820 --> 00:21:04,090
-Oh, that's really okay. -Yeah. We totally understand.
-沒事， -我們理解

301
00:21:04,260 --> 00:21:07,850
-Dating is hard. -Boy, you people are nice.
-約會可夠人受的 -你們真是好人

302
00:21:09,600 --> 00:21:11,390
And I've got to say..
我得說…

303
00:21:11,570 --> 00:21:15,330
I think you're going to make excellent parents.
你們一定會是很棒的父母

304
00:21:18,840 --> 00:21:20,240
Laura!
勞拉！

305
00:21:27,350 --> 00:21:29,140
We're back.
我們回來啦

306
00:21:30,020 --> 00:21:32,280
Are you here to take more money?
還想要錢

307
00:21:32,450 --> 00:21:35,080
Because I think what you're looking for is an ATM.
你們應該找提款機

308
00:21:35,720 --> 00:21:37,950
No, no, we're here to give the money back.
不不, 我們把錢退給你們

309
00:21:38,130 --> 00:21:42,030
Yeah. Because you know what? It's all about the children.
為了孩子

310
00:21:42,200 --> 00:21:44,820
Although it's also about the wedding.
至於我們的婚禮

311
00:21:46,400 --> 00:21:48,960
All right, here. No. Oh, God.
好吧, 給.不要!喔天啊!

312
00:21:49,140 --> 00:21:52,660
If I haven't said so already, sir, congratulations.
好像忘了道喜，恭喜你們

313
00:21:53,470 --> 00:21:55,000
Oh, wait. Wait.
哦, 等等

314
00:21:55,180 --> 00:21:58,040
What if we give half to the charity and we keep half?
如果我們捐一半留一半呢?

315
00:21:58,210 --> 00:22:02,740
Or, no, like,75 percent for us and 25 percent for.. Or, no, like,90-10.
或者, 就像我們留75%, 而另外25%... 或者, 就像9--1分帳....

316
00:22:02,920 --> 00:22:05,110
Okay, you know what? Enough, all right?
好啦!你知道嗎?已經夠了, 好嗎?

317
00:22:05,290 --> 00:22:07,250
I'm stepping in and putting my foot down.
我要插手, 而且做決定

318
00:22:07,420 --> 00:22:11,080
As your future husband, I'm gonna make this decision for us.
作為你的 未來老公，我要說了算

319
00:22:12,090 --> 00:22:14,560
What do you think we should do?
你說咋辦？

320
00:22:15,230 --> 00:22:18,560
-It's not your decision anymore. -What?
-不是你們說了算了 -什麼？

321
00:22:18,730 --> 00:22:22,000
On behalf of the children of New York, I reject your money.
代表紐約兒童，我拒收你們的捐款

322
00:22:22,740 --> 00:22:25,730
-But we're giving you this. -And I'm giving it back to you.
-但是我們在給你錢啊 -退給你們

323
00:22:25,910 --> 00:22:28,810
Come on. Consider it a contribution.
當作禮金好了

324
00:22:30,080 --> 00:22:32,600
Well, this is very generous.
你真大方

325
00:22:32,780 --> 00:22:37,510
Take the check. Have a great wedding and a wonderful life together.
支票拿走，祝婚禮成功，幸福甜蜜

326
00:22:37,680 --> 00:22:40,680
Sounds good to me. We can save up, come back in a few years..
聽來不錯，我們以後存了錢

327
00:22:40,850 --> 00:22:42,650
and make an even bigger donation.
過兩年捐更多

328
00:22:42,820 --> 00:22:44,620
And when you do, ask for Brian.
好得很，下次記得找布萊恩捐

329
00:22:44,790 --> 00:22:46,090
-Oh, is that you? -No.
-布萊恩是你? -不！

330
00:22:51,870 --> 00:22:53,230
Hello?
喂？

331
00:22:54,170 --> 00:22:55,960
Oh, hi.
哦，嗨！

332
00:22:56,940 --> 00:23:00,840
Oh, my God, really? I can't wait to tell Chandler.
喂，天啊，真的，等不及要告訴錢德

333
00:23:01,010 --> 00:23:02,740
Okay. Goodbye.
好，再見！

334
00:23:03,180 --> 00:23:06,770
-Wrong number? -That was Laura.
－打錯電話的？ －是勞拉

335
00:23:06,950 --> 00:23:10,210
She gave us a great report and we're officially on the waiting list.
她替我們大大美言 我們正式上了領養排隊名單

336
00:23:10,380 --> 00:23:12,940
-That's great. -Now we just wait for a call..
－太好了！ －下個電話

337
00:23:13,120 --> 00:23:16,490
and someone tells us there's a baby waiting for us.
就會有人說有BB等我們去領養了

338
00:23:28,840 --> 00:23:30,230
Hello?
喂?

339
00:23:30,900 --> 00:23:32,570
Have you seen Joey's bat?
看見喬伊的球棒嗎？

340
00:23:38,310 --> 00:23:41,010
Okay. I got a spider.
好了， 我捉到了蜘蛛！

341
00:23:41,180 --> 00:23:43,340
There were two, I picked the bigger one.
有兩隻，我挑了大的一隻。

342
00:23:44,750 --> 00:23:47,190
-Okay. -Okay.
-好的 -好的

343
00:23:50,690 --> 00:23:52,890
This feels perfectly normal.
感覺一切正常。

344
00:23:54,030 --> 00:23:56,500
Okay, get on the swing.
好了，你上鞦韆去

345
00:23:58,400 --> 00:24:00,060
Okay.
好啊

346
00:24:00,770 --> 00:24:03,000
Okay.
好

347
00:24:08,780 --> 00:24:10,210
Okay.
好啊！

348
00:24:18,080 --> 00:24:20,750
-See? -All right. I can do this.
-看到了嗎? -啊，沒事了，我可以玩鞦韆了。

349
00:24:20,920 --> 00:24:22,820
There you go. Good for you.
是啊。幹得好！

350
00:24:22,990 --> 00:24:25,420
You know what? I'm getting used to this little guy.
知道嗎？ 我習慣小蜘蛛啦。

351
00:24:25,590 --> 00:24:30,090
-I don't even feel him in here anymore. -That's because he's on your neck.
-完全沒有異樣的感覺。 -因為它爬上你脖子啦

352
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


353
00:00:00,000 --> 00:00:00,000


